Z||000033||JSocha||12-07-2001||09:23 AM||||<B>Dear Santa...</B><P>You must be surprised that I'm writing to you today, the 26th of December. Well, I would very much like to clear up certain things that have occurred since the beginning of the month, filled with illusion, I wrote you my letter. I asked for a bicycle, an electric train set, a pair of rollerblades, and a football uniform. <P>I destroyed my brain studying the whole year. Not only was I the first in my class, but I had the best grades in the whole school. I'm not going to lie to you, there was no one in my entire neighborhood that behaved better than me, with my parents, my brothers, my friends, and with my neighbors. <P>I would go on errands, and even help the elderly cross the street. There was virtually nothing within reach that I would not do for humanity. <P>What cohonas do you have leaving me a ****king yo-yo, a stupid whistle and a pair of socks? What the **** were you thinking, you fat son of a b*tch, that you've taken me for a sucker the whole ****king year to come out with some sh*t like this under the tree. <P>As if you hadn't ****ed me enough, you gave that little faggot across the street so many toys that he can't even walk into his house. <P>Please don't let me see you trying to fit your big fat azz down my chimney next year. <P>I'll **** you up. I'll throw rocks at those stupid reindeer and scare them away so you'll have to walk back to the ****ing North Pole, just like what I have to do now since you didn't get me that ****ing bike. <P>#@*# YOU SANTA. Next year you'll find out how bad I can be, you FAT-SON-OF-A-B*TCH.<P>Sincerely yours,<BR>Little Johnny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>=============================================<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
Z||000034||Springtyme||12-07-2001||09:30 AM||||An inner city school teacher wanted to make sure that her students knew the sounds of farm animals. She went around the room asking each student a different animal sound.<P>Techer: Does anyone know what sound a sheep makes?<BR>Little Suzy raises her hand, and the teacher calls on her.<BR>Suzy: Baaaah, baaaah<P>Teacher: Very good! Does anyone know what sound a horse makes?<BR>Little Billy raises his hand and the teacher calls on him.<BR>Billy: Neigh, neigh!<P>This goes on for a few minutes until the teacher asks, "Does anyone know what sound a pig makes?" Little Johnny raises his hand, and the teacher calls on him.<P>He stands up on top of his desk, takes a depe breath and shouts "UP AGAINST THE WALL MOTHER-****ER!!!!!!!!!!"<BR>~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~<P>I guess this was after Christmas though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
